  "article": [
    {
      "level": 2,
      "heading": "Discussion",
      "paragraphs": [
        {
          "text": "If you migrate a subscription that is to renew to another SKU, provide the item that is to renew in the `SubscriptionMigrateRenewalItem`.\nFor example, if a customer downgrades a subscription, the subscription continues unchanged until the end of the billing period, and downgrades when it renews. If you migrate a subscription in this state before the end of the billing period, you need to provide the item that renews.",
          "refs": []
        }
      ],
